#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid ""
"These functions calculate the complex arc cosine of I<z>.  If I<y\\ =\\ "
"cacos(z)>, then I<z\\ =\\ ccos(y)>.  The real part of I<y> is chosen in the "
"interval [0,pi]."
msgstr ""
"Diese Funktionen berechnen den komplexen Arcus Cosinus von I<z>. Wenn I<y\\ "
"=\\ cacos(z)> ist, dann ist I<z\\ =\\ ccos(y)>. Für den Realteil von I<y> "
"wird ein Wert aus dem Intervall [0,Pi] verwendet."

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "One has:"
msgstr "Es gilt:"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "    cacos(z) = -i * clog(z + i * csqrt(1 - z * z))\n"
msgstr "    cacos(z) = -i * clog(z + i * csqrt(1 - z * z))\n"

